    { "type": "text", "id": "final_caption", "x": 60, "y": 638, "width": 780, "height": 44,
      "text": "Enforced as a monotonic state machine at the data layer -- an out-of-order \"delivered\" ack\ncan never overwrite an already-\"read\" status.",
